@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About TaskTracker</PageTitle>

<h1>About TaskTracker</h1>

<p>
    TaskTracker helps you organize daily tasks,
    track your progress, and keep your tasks saved.
</p>

<h2>How to use</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Enter a task name and click Add Task.</li>
    <li>Use the checkbox to mark a task complete or incomplete.</li>
    <li>Click Edit to change a task name, then Save.</li>
    <li>Click Cancel to discard your edits.</li>
    <li>Click Delete to remove a task.</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Tasks are stored in SQLite and remain available
    after restarting the application.
</p>

<p>Developed by Manoj Mandal for the CIT-250 capstone project.</p>

